    "UIName": "Master Orion MO-O1",
    "Id": "mechdef_master_orion_MO-O1",
    "Name": "Master Orion MO-O1",
    "Details": "The original attempt to create a 'Mech around the Mauler Laser, the MO-O1 only served to bring out the major drawback with the experimental laser, its range. The combined heat generation of the Mauler and the four other Large X-Pulse lasers is so great that there is no feasible way to cool the 'Mech without huge investments in hard to acquire technology. Combined with the short range of the Mauler, the prototype proved to be highly unsuccessful.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Cooling Jacket - Laser</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.28</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_masterorion"
  },
